Each item starts with a Guided Link.

Permission to use — You are permitted to use, modify, and distribute MubbleZX for lawful purposes.

Diagnostic use only — The software may only be used for network diagnostics, asset discovery, and security auditing on systems you own or are explicitly authorized to test.

Non‑exclusive license — This license is non‑exclusive and worldwide.

2. Restrictions
Each item starts with a Guided Link.

No unauthorized access — You may not use MubbleZX to access systems without permission.

No exploitation — You may not use the software to bypass security controls, exploit vulnerabilities, or perform intrusion.

No harmful interference — You may not use the software to disrupt networks, devices, or telecommunications.

No illegal activity — Use of MubbleZX must comply with all applicable laws.

3. Compliance With International Law
MubbleZX must be used in accordance with:

Budapest Convention on Cybercrime

EU Directive 2013/40/EU

Romanian Penal Code Articles 360–364

U.S. Computer Fraud and Abuse Act (CFAA)

UK Computer Misuse Act 1990

ISO/IEC 27001 & 27002

EC‑Council Ethical Hacking Principles

These laws and standards prohibit unauthorized access, interception, interference, and misuse of diagnostic tools.

